  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Seven Star Child points a finger at Shi Lei and names one star finger. Starlight bursts from his fingertip, tears through space in the blink of an eye, and pierces Shi Lei’s chest. One Star Finger and Shocking Rock Break are both attacking methods with short activation time and great offensive power. Shi Lei moves his body in time, so his heart is not destroyed. Countless star path dao marks sit at the wound near his heart. Blood spews from the front and back of his chest. Ordinary mortal Gu and mortal healing killer moves cannot help. After a healing Immortal Gu treats him, the blood stops spewing and flows down his chest like a stream.",
      "chapters": [
        726
      ],
